    Dated Log    -----> Configuration files of current testing are saved under ${local_path_log}/Conf_files/\n

Get Journal gNB And AP
    [Documentation]     Critical step: Need KW Creation Directory For Logs.
    [Arguments]     ${path_remote}=/tmp
    ...             ${local_path_script}=${script_path}
    ...             ${local_path_logs}=${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}
    Dated Log     [Getting journal gNB an AP]
    Dated Log     -----> Uploading scripts for gNB:${script_path}/${script_journal_gnb}
    # GNB
    ${alias_gnb}      SSH Wait For Connect      ${GNB_DU.sys[0].M}
    SSH Upload Script           alias=${alias_gnb}
    ...                         localPath=${CURDIR}/${local_path_script}
    ...                         scriptFile=${script_journal_gnb}
    ...                         remotePath=${path_remote}
    Dated log     -----> Executing script:[sh ${path_remote}/${script_journal_gnb}]
    ${output}                   SSH Cmd
    ...                         command=sh ${path_remote}/${script_journal_gnb}
    ...                         alias=${alias_gnb}
    # Airphone
    Dated Log     -----> Uploading scripts for AP:${script_path}/${script_journal_ap}
    ${alias_ap}        SSH Wait For Connect       ${AP_DU.sys[0].M}
    SSH Upload Script           alias=${alias_ap}
    ...                         localPath=${CURDIR}/${local_path_script}
    ...                         scriptFile=${script_journal_ap}
    ...                         remotePath=${path_remote}
    Dated log     -----> Executing script:[sh ${path_remote}/${script_journal_ap}]
    ${output}                    SSH Cmd
    ...                          command=sh ${path_remote}/${script_journal_ap}
    ...                          alias=${alias_ap}
    Dated log     -----> Waiting the collection of the logs...
    sleep     15s
    #Collect gNB logs
    Dated log     -----> Compressing gNB logs...
    ${output}                       SSH Cmd       command=cd /tmp/Logs_gNB;tar cvzf journal_gNB.tgz *
    ...                             alias=${alias_gnb}
    Sleep    5s
    Dated log     -----> Downloading gNB logs...
    csn.download_file               remote_path=/tmp/Logs_gNB/journal_gNB.tgz
    ...                             local_path=${local_path_logs}/journal_gNB.tgz
    ...                             connection=${alias_gnb}
    #Collect AP logs
    Dated log     -----> Compressing AP logs...
    ${output}                       SSH Cmd       command=cd /tmp/Logs_AP;tar cvzf journal_AP.tgz *
    ...                             alias=${alias_ap}
    Sleep    5s
    Dated log     -----> Downloading AP logs...
    csn.download_file               remote_path=/tmp/Logs_AP/journal_AP.tgz
    ...                             local_path=${local_path_logs}/journal_AP.tgz
    ...                             connection=${alias_ap}
    Dated log New Line    LOGS: Journal logs are saved under ${local_path_logs}\n

Get GNB Snapshot
    [Arguments]     ${local_log_path}=${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}
    Dated Log     [Collecting gNB snapshot]
    ${timestamp}=    DateTime.Get Current Date    result_format=%Y%m%d-%H%M
    coam.connect to   bts_host=${tl.gnbs[0].cu.oam_http_connection_details.addr}   name=coam_admin
    coam.get_snapshot     target_file_name=${local_log_path}/Snapshot_GNB_${timestamp}.zip    timeout=720    connection=coam_admin
    Dated Log     LOGS: gNB snapshot is saved under ${local_log_path}/Snapshot_GNB_${timestamp}.zip\n
    [Teardown]  coam.teardown    connection=coam_admin

Get Robot Debug Logs
    run    command=cp ${OUTPUT DIR}/*.log ${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}/CRT_debug.log

Move Pcap Into Log Folder
    [Documentation]     Move all the pcap files of the tests into log folder
    Dated Log    [Moving the pcap files of the test into log folder]
    #Move pcap files into log folder
    # run    command=mv ${capture_gnb_x2.path} ${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}
    run    command=mv ${capture_gnb_l1l2.path} ${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}
    # run    command=mv ${capture_gnb_l3l2.path} ${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}
    # run    command=mv ${capture_ap_l1l2.path} ${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}
    Dated Log    The pcap files have been moved to ${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}.\n

Move Sosreport Into Log Folder
    Dated Log New Line    [Moving Sosreport in log folder]
    run    command=mv ${LOG_PATH}/*.tgz ${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}
    Dated Log    LOGS: Sosreport has been moved to ${LOCAL_LOG_PATH_gNB_AP}\n

Collect Sos Report
    Dated Log     [Collecting SosReport]
    Configure Sosreport Cfg UTE
    Get Sos Report
    Move Sosreport Into Log Folder

Configure Sosreport Cfg UTE
    [Arguments]    ${loner}=E    ${phoner}=PH7    ${l1mode}=fullstack
    Dated Log     [Configuring Sosreport CFG]
    ${output}                       SSH Cmd
    ...                             sed -i 's|LONER_VERSION=X|LONER_VERSION=${loner}|g' /opt/iphy/latest/sosReport.cfg
    ...                             alias=${HOST_EPCSIM.alias}
	Dated Log     -----> LONER_VERSION=E configured.
    ${output}                       SSH Cmd
    ...                             sed -i 's|PHONER_VERSION=X|PHONER_VERSION=${phoner}|g' /opt/iphy/latest/sosReport.cfg
    ...                             alias=${HOST_EPCSIM.alias}
	Dated Log     -----> PHONER_VERSION=PH7 configured.
    ${output}                       SSH Cmd
    ...                             sed -i 's|L1_MODE=X|L1_MODE=${l1mode}|g' /opt/iphy/latest/sosReport.cfg
    ...                             alias=${HOST_EPCSIM.alias}
	Dated Log     -----> L1_MODE=fullstack configured.
	Dated Log     Configuration of sosreport.cfg completed.\n

#****************************** Keywords for checks in RRC Setup ***************************************

#FROM 1242
Check In RRC Setup msg1FrequencyStart
    [Documentation]     Check in RRC setup that msg1FrequencyStart is configured outside the blanked area
    ...                 and according to NIDD setting.
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}    ${msg1_initialBWP}     ${msg1_bwpCommon}
    Dated Log    [Checking msg1FrequencyStart in RRC setup...]
    ${xpath_rrc_msg1}     Set Variable     nr-rrc.setup_element/nr-rrc.rach_ConfigGeneric_element/nr-rrc.msg1_FrequencyStart
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.initialUplinkBWP_element/nr-rrc.rach_ConfigCommon/${xpath_rrc_msg1}
    ...                             value=${msg1_initialBWP}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.bwp_Common_element/nr-rrc.rach_ConfigCommon/${xpath_rrc_msg1}
    ...                             test=>=
    ...                             value=${msg1_bwpCommon}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Checks of msg1FrequencyStart completed.\n


Check In RRC Setup AggregationLevel2
    [Documentation]     When the size of coreset is less or equal to 24 PRB, aggregation level shall be configured at AL2.
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}
    Dated Log    [Checking AggregationLevel2 In RRC Setup...]
    #Aggregationlevel2 is configured
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=nr-rrc.aggregationLevel2
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             test=!=
    ...                             value=0
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=nr-rrc.aggregationLevel4
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             test===
    ...                             value=0
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Checks AggregationLevel2 completed.\n

Check In RRC Setup Pucch Configuration
    [Documentation]     Check in RRC setup that PUCCH format0 and format2 are not configured inside the blanked area.
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}
    Dated Log    [Checking PUCCH format0 and format2 startingPRB configuration In RRC Setup...]
    #startingPRB upper than Low edge blanking
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.resourceToAddModList/.*./nr-rrc.startingPRB
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             test=>=
    ...                             value=${rat1_start}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking size of PUCCH format2 in RRC Setup...
    ${start_rb_hex}=    get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                               packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                               path=.*/nr-rrc.resourceToAddModList/_.4./nr-rrc.PUCCH_Resource_element/nr-rrc.startingPRB
    ...                               kind=show
    ...                               startPacket=${1}
    ...                               endPacket=${1}
    ${nr_of_prb_hex}=      get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...        packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...        path=.*/nr-rrc.resourceToAddModList/_.4./nr-rrc.PUCCH_Resource_element/nr-rrc.format/nr-rrc.format2_element/nr-rrc.nrofPRBs
    ...        kind=show
    ...        startPacket=${1}
    ...        endPacket=${1}
    ${start_rb_int}=    Convert To Integer     ${start_rb_hex}
    ${nr_of_prb_int}=      Convert To Integer       ${nr_of_prb_hex}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking start allocation...
    Dated Log    -----> startingRB=${start_rb_int} and nrofRBs=${nr_of_prb_int}
    Should Be True     ${start_rb_int} >= ${rat1_start}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking size allocation...
    ${check_crb_end}    Evaluate   ${start_rb_int}+${nr_of_prb_int}-1
    Dated Log    -----> crb end location is equal to ${check_crb_end}
    Should Be True     ${check_crb_end} <= ${rat1_end}
    Dated Log    -----> Checks completed.\n

Check In RRC Setup CSI RS Measurment Configuration
    [Documentation]     Check that CSI RS for periodic measurment (firstOFDMSymbolInTimeDomain: 13) is not configured inside the blanked area.
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}
    Dated Log    [Checking CSI RS for measurment configuration In RRC Setup...]
    #Item 0 only
	${xpath_csirs}    Set Variable    nr-rrc.nzp_CSI_RS_ResourceToAddModList/_.1./nr-rrc.NZP_CSI_RS_Resource_element/nr-rrc.resourceMapping_element
    Verification Rat0 Allocation In RRC    pdml_file_x2=${pdml_file}
    ...      xpath_start=.*/${xpath_csirs}/nr-rrc.freqBand_element/nr-rrc.startingRB
    ...      xpath_size=.*/${xpath_csirs}/nr-rrc.resourceMapping_element/nr-rrc.freqBand_element/nr-rrc.nrofRBs
    Dated Log    -----> Check completed.\n

Verification Rat0 Allocation In RRC
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file_x2}    ${xpath_start}    ${xpath_size}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking start allocation...
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file_x2}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=${xpath_start}
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             test=>=
    ...                             value=${rat0_start}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking size allocation...
    ${starting_rb}=      get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file_x2}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=${xpath_start}
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    ${nr_of_prb}=      get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file_x2}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=${xpath_size}
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> startingRB=${starting_rb} and nrofRBs=${nr_of_prb}
    ${check_crb}    Evaluate   ${starting_rb}+${nr_of_prb}-1
    Dated Log    -----> rat0_end location is equal to ${check_crb} and shall be less or equal than ${rat0_end}
    Should Be True     ${check_crb} <= ${rat0_end}

#FROM 2558
Check In X2 RRC Reconfiguration Is Completed
    [Documentation]   Check in X2 backhaul that RRC reconfiguration is completed during SgNBAddition procedure.
    [Arguments]      ${pdml_file}
    Dated Log    [Checking RRC reconfiguration is completed]
    analyzer.check_exists_once     pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBReconfigurationComplete
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.rrcReconfigurationComplete_element$
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             value=
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Check of RRC Reconfiguration completed.\n

Check In RRC Setup Coreset Configuration NSA Overlapping
    [Documentation]     In case of coreset0 is overlaped check in RRC setup that coresetO is not used
    ...                 and new coresetID is configured outside the blanked area according to BWP profile settings.
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}      ${coresetID_frequdomain}=000000000000
    Dated Log    [Checking Coreset configuration In RRC Setup...]
    Dated Log    -----> Checking coreset Id in bwp-Common
    #Check coreset Id in bwp-Common commonControlResourceSet
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.bwp_Common_element/.*/nr-rrc.controlResourceSetId$
    ...                             value=0
    ...                             test=!=
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    #Check coreset Id in bwp-Dedicated pdcch-Config
    Dated Log    -----> Checking coreset Id in bwp-Dedicated
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.bwp_Dedicated_element/.*/nr-rrc.controlResourceSetId$
    ...                             value=0
    ...                             test=!=
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    #Check coreset frequencyDomainResources in bwp-Common
    Dated Log    -----> Checking frequencyDomainResources
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.bwp_Common_element/.*/nr-rrc.frequencyDomainResources
    ...                             kind=value
    ...                             value=${coresetID_frequdomain}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    #Check coreset frequencyDomainResources in bwp-Dedicated
    #analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    #...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    #...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.bwp_Dedicated_element/.*/nr-rrc.frequencyDomainResources
    #...                             kind=value
    #...                             value=${coresetID_frequdomain}
    #...                             startPacket=${1}
    #...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Check of coreset completed.\n

Check In RRC Setup Coreset Configuration NSA Not Overlapping
    [Documentation]     Check in RRC setup the right configuration of coreset0 when it is not overlapped.
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}
    Dated Log    [Checking CoresetO configuration In RRC Setup...]
    #Check coreset Id in bwp-Common commonControlResourceSet
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
