    ...                             value=0
    ...                             test===
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    #Check coreset Id in bwp-Dedicated pdcch-Config
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.bwp_Dedicated_element/.*/nr-rrc.controlResourceSetId$
    ...                             value=0
    ...                             test===
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Check of coreset O completed.\n

Check In RRC Setup Pucch Allocation
    [Documentation]     Check in RRC setup that PUCCH format0 and format2 are not configured inside the blanked area.
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}
    Dated Log    [Checking in RRC setup the allocation of pucch format 0 and 2]
    Dated Log    StartingPRB shall greater or equal to ${param.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL}
    Dated Log    Crb end location shall be less than ${blanking_area_crb_high}
    #checking all startingPRB of pucch. Shall be upper than Low edge blanking
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.resourceToAddModList/.*./nr-rrc.startingPRB
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             test=>=
    ...                             value=${rat1_start}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Check of startingPRB completed.
    #Checking size allocation of pucch format 2
    #To get the number of item present in pucch resources
    Dated Log    -----> Checking size...
    ${length}    get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                               packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                               path=.*/nr-rrc.pucch_Config/.*/nr-rrc.resourceToAddModList$
    ...                               kind=show
    ...                               startPacket=${1}
    ...                               endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log   Length of pucch = ${length}
    ${range}     Evaluate    ${length}+1
    FOR    ${item}   IN RANGE   1   ${range}
         Dated Log    Pucch item ${item}/${length}
         #Check if item is format2. Will be PASS if it is forma2 otherwise it will be fail.
         ${Isformat2}    ${nrofPRB}=       Run Keyword And Ignore Error     get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
         ...      packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
         ...      path=.*/nr-rrc.resourceToAddModList/_.${item}./nr-rrc.PUCCH_Resource_element/nr-rrc.format/nr-rrc.format2_element/nr-rrc.nrofPRBs$
         ...      kind=show
         ...      startPacket=${1}
         ...      endPacket=${1}
         Run Keyword If    '${Isformat2}' == 'PASS'    Verify Allocation In RRC     pdml_file_x2=${pdml_file}
         ...                          xpath_start=.*/nr-rrc.resourceToAddModList/_.${item}./.*/nr-rrc.startingPRB$
         ...                          xpath_size=.*/nr-rrc.resourceToAddModList/_.${item}./.*/nr-rrc.nrofPRBs$
         ...                          limit_start=${param.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL}
         ...                          limit_size=${blanking_area_crb_high}
         ...                          packet_start=${1}
         ...                          packet_end=${1}
         ...    ELSE    Dated Log    -----> Pucch f0. Not needed to check size allocation.
    END
    Dated Log    -----> Check of pucch completd.\n

Check In RRC Setup SRS configuration
    [Documentation]   Check in RRC setup that SRS is correclty configured outside the blanked area.
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}    ${value_shift}   ${value_pos}    ${value_csrs}    ${value_bsrs}    ${value_bhop}
    Dated Log    [Checking SRS configuration in RRC Setup]

    #From SPEC: freqDomainShift =  offsetPrbUl %4  = 2, offsetPrbUl = msg1FrequencyStart
