    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Check of SRS freqDomainShift
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.SRS_Resource_element/nr-rrc.freqDomainShift
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             test=>=
    ...                             value=${value_shift}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Check of SRS freqHopping c_SRS
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.SRS_Resource_element/nr-rrc.freqHopping_element/nr-rrc.c_SRS
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             test===
    ...                             value=${value_csrs}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Check of SRS freqHopping b_SRS
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.SRS_Resource_element/nr-rrc.freqHopping_element/nr-rrc.b_SRS
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             test===
    ...                             value=${value_bsrs}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Check of SRS freqHopping b_hop
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
    ...                             path=.*/nr-rrc.SRS_Resource_element/nr-rrc.freqHopping_element/nr-rrc.b_hop
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             test===
    ...                             value=${value_bhop}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Check SRS configuration completed.\n

Check In RRC Setup CSI RS Measurment Allocation
    [Documentation]     Check that CSI RS for periodic measurment (firstOFDMSymbolInTimeDomain: 13) is not configured inside the blanked area.
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}
    Dated Log    [Checking CSI RS for measurment  In RRC Setup]
    Dated Log    StartPrb shall greater or equal to ${param.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL}
    Dated Log    crb end location shall be less than ${blanking_area_crb_high}
    #Item 0 only (CSI RS for measurment)
    ${xpath_csirs}    Set Variable    nr-rrc.nzp_CSI_RS_ResourceToAddModList/_.1./nr-rrc.NZP_CSI_RS_Resource_element/nr-rrc.resourceMapping_element

    ${csirs_meas_size}    Set Variable If
    ...            ${param.nbrOfBlankedPRBsHighEdgeDL} == 0    ${csi_rs_size}
    ...            ${param.nbrOfBlankedPRBsHighEdgeDL} > 0     ${blanking_area_crb_high}

    Verify Allocation In RRC     pdml_file_x2=${pdml_file}
    ...                          xpath_start=.*/${xpath_csirs}/nr-rrc.freqBand_element/nr-rrc.startingRB
    ...                          xpath_size=.*/${xpath_csirs}/nr-rrc.freqBand_element/nr-rrc.nrofRBs
    ...                          limit_start=${param.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL}
    ...                          limit_size=${csirs_meas_size}

    Dated Log    -----> Check completed.\n

#****************************** Keywords for checks in L2L1 ***************************************

#FROM 1242
Check In L2L1 Prachprboffset And Msg1
    [Documentation]    Check the configuration of prachprb0ffset is outside the blankedd area and msg1 is correctly received.
    Dated Log    [Checking In L2L1 Prachprboffset And Msg1]
    Dated Log    -----> Check in L2L1 prachPrbOffset and msg1.
    ${pcap_filtered}         Filter Pcap     ${capture_gnb_l1l2.path}     messages=uldata_prachreceivereq or uldata_prachreceiveind
    ...                                                                   name=prach_msg1_only
    ${pdml_file}         Generate Pdml From Pcap          ${pcap_filtered}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking of prachPrbOffset in uldata_prachreceivereq...
    ${prach_prb_hex}=    get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                                packetName=uldata_prachreceivereq
    ...                                path=.*/UlData_PrachReceiveReq.subcells_item_.*.prachPrbOffset$
    ...                                kind=show
    ...                                startPacket=${1}
    ...                                endPacket=${1}
    ${prach_prb_int}=    Convert To Integer     ${prach_prb_hex}
    Dated Log    -----> Prachprboffset is equal to ${prach_prb_int}.
    Should Be True     ${prach_prb_int} >= ${prach_prb_offset}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking of msg1...
    ${msg1_preamble_hex}=    get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                                    packetName=uldata_prachreceiveind
    ...                                    path=.*/UlData_PrachReceiveInd.detectedPrachPreambles_item_.*.prachPreambleIndex$
    ...                                    kind=show
    ...                                    startPacket=${1}
    ...                                    endPacket=${1}
    ${msg1_preamble_int}=    Convert To Integer     ${msg1_preamble_hex}
    Dated Log    -----> Msg1 is received and prachPreambleIndex is equal to ${msg1_preamble_int}
    Dated Log    -----> Checks completed.\n

Check In L2L1 Pucch Attach Configuration
    Dated Log    [Checking In L2L1 Pucch Attach Configuration]
