Check Pdsch Rat1 Allocation Msg2
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}
    ${start_rb_hex}=    get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=dldata_pdschsendreq
    ...                             path=.*/DlData_PdschSendReq.PdschSendReq.startPrb
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    ${nr_of_prb_hex}=      get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=dldata_pdschsendreq
    ...                             path=.*/DlData_PdschSendReq.PdschSendReq.numOfPrb
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    ${start_rb_int}=      Convert To Integer       ${start_rb_hex}
    ${nr_of_prb_int}=      Convert To Integer       ${nr_of_prb_hex}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking start allocation of pdsch msg2...
    Dated Log    -----> startingRB=${start_rb_int} and nrofRBs=${nr_of_prb_int}
    Dated Log    -----> startingRB shall greater or equal to nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL=${param.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL}
    Should Be True     ${start_rb_int} >= ${rat1_start}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking size allocation of msg2...
    ${check_crb_end}    Evaluate   ${start_rb_int}+${nr_of_prb_int}-1
    Dated Log    -----> crb end location is equal to ${check_crb_end} and shall be less or equal than ${rat1_end}
    Should Be True     ${check_crb_end} <= ${rat1_end}
    Dated Log    -----> Checks completed.\n

Check Pusch Rat1 Allocation Msg3
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking msg3 Rat1 allocation in attach procedure...
    ${start_rb_hex}=    get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=uldata_puschreceivereq
    ...                             path=.*/UlData_PuschReceiveReq.grants_item_.*.startPrb
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    ${nr_of_prb_hex}=      get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                             packetName=uldata_puschreceivereq
    ...                             path=.*/UlData_PuschReceiveReq.grants_item_.*.numOfPrb
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    ${start_rb_int}=    Convert To Integer     ${start_rb_hex}
    ${nr_of_prb_int}=      Convert To Integer       ${nr_of_prb_hex}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking start allocation of pusch msg3...
    Dated Log    -----> startingRB shall greater or equal to nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL=${param.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL}
    Dated Log    -----> startingRB=${start_rb_int} and nrofRBs=${nr_of_prb_int}
    Should Be True     ${start_rb_int} >= ${rat1_start}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking size allocation of msg3...
    ${check_crb_end}    Evaluate   ${start_rb_int}+${nr_of_prb_int}-1
    Dated Log    -----> crb end of msg3 is located at ${check_crb_end} and shall be less or equal than ${rat1_end}
    Should Be True     ${check_crb_end} <= ${rat1_end}
    Dated Log    -----> Check completed.\n

# Keyword updated to fit MCShark pdml
Check In L2L1 CSI RS Measurment Allocation
    [Arguments]                     ${pdml_file}    ${start}    ${end}
    FOR    ${packet_num}            IN RANGE    1     6
        Dated Log New Line          Checking packet ${packet_num}/5
        ${packetsMatch}             Get Packet Match List
        ...                             pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
        ...                             packetName=dldata_csirssendreq
        ...                             pathList=${listFieldCsi}
        ...                             startPacket=${${packet_num}}
        ...                             endPacket=${${packet_num}}
        Verify CSI RS Allocation In L2L1
        ...                         packetMatch=${packetsMatch[0]}
		...                         start_limit_csi=${start}
        ...                         size_limit_csi=${end}
    END
    Dated Log    Check of CSI RS for measurment allocation completed.\n

# Keyword updated to fit MCShark pdml
Verify CSI RS Allocation In L2L1
    [Arguments]                     ${packetMatch}
    ...                             ${start_limit_csi}    ${size_limit_csi}	
    @{listPath}                     Get Paths matching Field
    ...                                 packetMatch=${packetMatch}
    ...                                 field=startSymbol
    ${nb}                           Get length                              ${listPath}
    ${item}                         set Variable                            ${0}
    Dated Log                       -----> Nb CSI = ${nb}.
    Run Keyword If                  ${nb}>1
    ...                             Run keywords
    ...                                 Dated Log     -----> Skipping packet (length > 1).
    ...      AND                        Return from keyword
    FOR    ${path}         IN      @{listPath}
        ${value}                    set variable                            ${packetMatch.fields['${path}'].show}
        Dated log                   \tSYMBOL=${value} PATH=${path}
        Run Keyword If              '${value}' == '13'
        ...                         Verification Rat0 Allocation In L2L1
        ...                             packetMatch=${packetMatch}
        ...                             csi_item=${item}
        ...                             rat0_limit_start=${start_limit_csi}
        ...                             rat0_limit_size=${size_limit_csi}
        ...    ELSE                 Dated Log                               \t\tItem${item}:Skipping (symbol <> 13).
        ${item}                     evaluate                                ${item} + 1
    END

# Keyword updated to fit MCShark pdml
Verification Rat0 Allocation In L2L1
    [Arguments]                     ${packetMatch}                          ${csi_item}
    ...                             ${rat0_limit_start}                     ${rat0_limit_size} 	
    Dated log                       \t\tItem${csi_item}:Verification Rat0 Allocation In L2L1

    @{listPathStart}                Get Paths matching Field
    ...                                 packetMatch=${packetMatch}          field=startPrb
    ${path}                         set variable                            ${listPathStart[${csi_item}]}
	${start_rb_hex}                 set variable                            ${packetMatch.fields['${path}'].show}
    Dated log                       \t\tItem${csi_item}:startPrb=${start_rb_hex} PATH=${path}

    @{listPathNum}                  Get Paths matching Field
    ...                                 packetMatch=${packetMatch}          field=numOfPrb
    ${path}                         set variable                            ${listPathNum[${csi_item}]}
	${nr_of_prb_hex}                set variable                            ${packetMatch.fields['${path}'].show}	
    Dated log                       \t\tItem${csi_item}:numOfPrb=${nr_of_prb_hex} PATH=${path}

    ${start_rb_int}=    Convert To Integer      ${start_rb_hex}
    ${nr_of_prb_int}=   Convert To Integer      ${nr_of_prb_hex}
    ${check_crb_end}    Evaluate   ${start_rb_int}+${nr_of_prb_int}-1
    Dated Log    -----> [startPrb:${start_rb_int} ; numOfPrb:${nr_of_prb_int} ; crb_end:${check_crb_end}]\n
    Should Be True     ${start_rb_int} >= ${rat0_limit_start}
    Should Be True     ${check_crb_end} <= ${rat0_limit_size}
	
Verification Rat1 Allocation In L2L1
    [Arguments]  ${pdml_file}    ${packet_name}    ${xpath_start}    ${xpath_size}   ${packet_start}=1    ${packet_end}=1
    ${start_rb_hex}=    get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                               packetName=${packet_name}
    ...                               path=${xpath_start}
    ...                               kind=show
    ...                               startPacket=${${packet_start}}
    ...                               endPacket=${${packet_end}}
    ${nr_of_prb_hex}=      get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...                                  packetName=${packet_name}
    ...                                  path=${xpath_size}
    ...                                  kind=show
    ...                                  startPacket=${${packet_start}}
    ...                                  endPacket=${${packet_end}}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking start allocation...
    Dated Log    -----> startingRB=${start_rb_int} and nrofRBs=${nr_of_prb_int}
    Should Be True     ${start_rb_int} >= ${rat1_start}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking size allocation...
    ${check_crb_end}    Evaluate   ${start_rb_int}+${nr_of_prb_int}-1
    Dated Log    -----> crb end location is equal to ${check_crb_end}
    Should Be True     ${check_crb_end} <= ${rat1_end}

Check Pucch Rat1 Allocation In L2L1
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file}
    Dated Log    Checking Rat0 allocation of pucch...
    ${nbr_pucch_packet}    count_path    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
    ...    packetName=uldata_pucchreceivereq
    ...    path=.*/UlData_PucchReceiveReq.pucchResources_item_.*.startPrb$
    FOR    ${packet}    IN RANGE    1    ${nbr_pucch_packet}
         Dated Log    -----> Checking pucch packet number ${packet}/${nbr_pucch_packet}
         ${start_rb_hex}=    get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
         ...                             packetName=uldata_pucchreceivereq
         ...                             path=.*/UlData_PucchReceiveReq.pucchResources_item_.*.startPrb$
         ...                             kind=show
         ...                             startPacket=${${packet}}
         ...                             endPacket=${${packet}}
         ${nr_of_prb_hex}=      get_unique    pdmlFile=${pdml_file}
         ...                             packetName=uldata_pucchreceivereq
         ...                             path=.*/UlData_PucchReceiveReq.pucchResources_item_.*.numOfPrb$
         ...                             kind=show
         ...                             startPacket=${${packet}}
         ...                             endPacket=${${packet}}
         ${start_rb_int}=    Convert To Integer     ${start_rb_hex}
         ${nr_of_prb_int}=      Convert To Integer       ${nr_of_prb_hex}
         Dated Log    -----> startingRB=${start_rb_int} and nrofRBs=${nr_of_prb_int}
         Should Be True     ${start_rb_int} >= ${rat1_start}
         ${check_crb_end}    Evaluate   ${start_rb_int}+${nr_of_prb_int}-1
         ${rat1_end}        Evaluate   ${total_prb_bw}-${param.nbrOfBlankedPRBsHighEdgeUL}
         Should Be True     ${check_crb_end} <= ${rat1_end}
    END
    Dated Log    Check of Rat0 allocation for pucch completed.

Check In Pdcch PdcchDciTransmitPower
    [Documentation]     Verification In DCI that pdcchDciTransmitPower is added 3db when coreset size
    ...                 is less or equal to 24 PRB. Value of pdcchDciTransmitPower should be equal to -250.
    [Arguments]    ${path_pdml}     ${power_value}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking pdcchDciTransmitPower in pdcch...
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${path_pdml}
    ...                             packetName=dldata_pdcchsendreq
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             path=pdcchDciTransmitPower$
    ...                             value=${power_value}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${2}
    Dated Log    -----> Check completed.

Check In Pdcch AggregationLevel
    [Documentation]     Aggregation level shall be equal to AL2 when coreset size is less or equal to 24 PRB.
    [Arguments]    ${path_pdml}     ${agg_value}
    Dated Log    -----> Checking AggregationLevel in pdcch...
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${path_pdml}
    ...                             packetName=dldata_pdcchsendreq
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             path=aggregationLevel$
    ...                             value=${agg_value}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${2}
    Dated Log    -----> Check completed.

Check In Pdcch CoresetFreqDomain With Dss Ph1
    [Documentation]     The bitmap of CoresetFreqDomain shall be configured outside the blanked area.
    [Arguments]    ${path_pdml}     ${coreset1_value}=0x0000000000000000
    Dated Log    -----> Checking initial and dedicated CoresetFreqDomain in pdcch with DSS Ph1...
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${path_pdml}
    ...                             packetName=dldata_pdcchsendreq
    ...                             kind=show
    ...                             path=coresetFreqDomain$
    ...                             value=${coreset1_value}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${2}
    Dated Log    -----> Check completed.

Verfication In Msg1
    [Arguments]    ${path_pcap}
    ...            ${packet_to_check}
    ...            ${field_to_check}
    ...            ${value_to_check}
    ${pcap_filtered}         Filter Pcap     ${path_pcap}     messages=dldata_pdcchsendreq or uldata_prachreceiveind    name=pdcch_only
    #${pdml_file}         Generate Pdml From Pcap          ${pcapFile_filtered_pdcch}
