    ...                             path=${field_to_check}
    ...                             value=${value_to_check}
    ...                             startPacket=${1}
    ...                             endPacket=${1}
    Dated Log    -----> Analysis in ${packet_to_check} for ${field_to_check} completed

Verification Field In DCI Msg2
    [Arguments]    ${pdml_file_L1L2}
    ...            ${field_to_check}
    ...            ${value_to_check}
    Dated Log    -----> Analyzing of PDML ongoing in dldata_pdcchsendreq msg2 for ${field_to_check} with value ${value_to_check}
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdml_file_L1L2}
    ...                             packetName=dldata_pdcchsendreq
